        "Description": "Welcome to Sapienza, 47, where European leaders will soon meet to negotiate a massive new united defence strategy against external threats, and where Providence has set up a city-wide CCTV network to monitor them. Disable the network and eliminate the Providence operatives who maintain it.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
